        "content": "<p>rvolosatovs opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14707\">PR #14707</a> from <code>rvolosatovs:wasi-http-append-raw-size</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><code>FieldMap::append_raw</code> updated the tracked size before calling <code>HeaderMap::try_append</code>, so when the map was full the field was rejected with <code>TooManyFields</code> but its size stayed counted. Check the limit first and only commit the new size once the append succeeds.</p>\n<p>Noticed while reviewing #14702, which will fix the analogous error in <code>set</code></p>\n</blockquote>",
